WEBVTT

00:00:08.655 --> 00:00:10.198
[leg squeaks]

00:00:10.782 --> 00:00:12.200
[sputtering sigh]

00:00:12.284 --> 00:00:13.994
[others grunt and cough]

00:00:14.077 --> 00:00:15.746
[whistling a tune]

00:00:21.168 --> 00:00:22.502
[panting]

00:00:23.545 --> 00:00:24.546
[Valka grunts]

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:33.513
[gasps softly]

00:00:37.184 --> 00:00:38.226
[gasps]

00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:39.311
[dragon snarls]

00:00:39.978 --> 00:00:41.271
[Valka shouts]

00:00:41.605 --> 00:00:43.190
[Valka grunting]

00:00:44.566 --> 00:00:45.609
Watch out!

00:00:46.234 --> 00:00:47.986
[dragons snarling]

00:00:49.863 --> 00:00:51.156
Go, Cloudjumper!

00:00:52.032 --> 00:00:54.367
[distant whistling]

00:01:02.959 --> 00:01:04.795
[Toothless calling]

00:01:14.221 --> 00:01:15.263
[grunts softly]

00:01:21.770 --> 00:01:22.771
[groans sadly]

00:01:22.854 --> 00:01:24.731
[explosive whooshes in distance]

00:01:38.578 --> 00:01:39.788
[grunts excitedly]

00:01:43.125 --> 00:01:44.334
[purrs]

00:01:50.257 --> 00:01:51.883
[purring]

00:02:00.892 --> 00:02:02.477
[thunder rumbling]

00:02:10.235 --> 00:02:11.111
[purrs]

00:02:17.325 --> 00:02:18.201
[grunts]

00:02:35.468 --> 00:02:36.845
[groans]

00:02:39.306 --> 00:02:40.640
[purrs]

00:02:44.269 --> 00:02:46.438
[snarling and electricity crackling]

00:02:46.980 --> 00:02:48.440
[shrieking]

00:02:50.066 --> 00:02:51.443
[thunder rumbles]

00:02:51.902 --> 00:02:52.944
[groans]

00:02:55.947 --> 00:02:57.532
[burps and groans]

00:02:59.993 --> 00:03:01.995
[Light Fury whinnies and calls]

00:03:21.514 --> 00:03:23.892
[both grunting softly]

00:03:39.699 --> 00:03:41.952
[water rumbling]

00:03:49.626 --> 00:03:52.295
[both grunting]

00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:03.473
-[crowd cheering]
-[festive music playing]

00:04:03.556 --> 00:04:04.599
[Gobber] To the chief.

00:04:04.683 --> 00:04:05.976
[crowd cheers]

00:04:06.059 --> 00:04:07.143
[all] To the chief!

00:04:07.227 --> 00:04:08.895
-Aye! To our chief.
-[crowd cheers]

00:04:09.354 --> 00:04:11.439
A chip off the old block.

00:04:11.523 --> 00:04:14.150
Okay, guys. Now, I'm just getting sick.

00:04:14.609 --> 00:04:15.819
Okay. [chuckles]

00:04:16.027 --> 00:04:17.028
[retches]

00:04:17.112 --> 00:04:19.864
Gotta say, I thought you were
well off your rocker,

00:04:19.948 --> 00:04:21.950
but this spot ain't half bad.

00:04:22.033 --> 00:04:24.327
This was supposed to be
a temporary solution.

00:04:24.411 --> 00:04:25.787
It's unanimous.

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:28.415
Everyone agrees
we've definitely traded up.

00:04:28.498 --> 00:04:30.792
-Well done, Chief.
-[forced chuckle]

00:04:31.167 --> 00:04:32.502
What if the tail broke?

00:04:32.585 --> 00:04:35.672
What if Grimmel found him?
What if he needs me?

00:04:35.755 --> 00:04:36.840
Would you relax?

00:04:36.923 --> 00:04:39.467
He's probably having the time of his life.

00:04:39.551 --> 00:04:41.303
How would I know? She never comes around,

00:04:41.386 --> 00:04:44.139
and when she does,
she's always rushing off.

00:04:44.723 --> 00:04:47.475
I'm saying, how...
How do we know if she's right for us?

00:04:47.559 --> 00:04:48.685
Us?

00:04:48.768 --> 00:04:51.646
You know what I mean.
She's so wild and skittish.

00:04:51.730 --> 00:04:52.814
I'm just gonna say it.

00:04:52.897 --> 00:04:53.898
I don't trust her.

00:04:53.982 --> 00:04:56.443
[laughs] Can't tame 'em all, Hiccup.

00:04:56.526 --> 00:04:59.154
One day you'll have to snip
those apron strings

00:04:59.237 --> 00:05:01.364
and let Toothless stretch his wings.

00:05:01.823 --> 00:05:05.452
Reminds me of a talk
I had with Stoick about you. Gah!

00:05:06.619 --> 00:05:08.163
Where do they keep coming from?

00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:11.166
-Who?
-Those bloody Hobgobblers.

00:05:11.249 --> 00:05:14.127
I swear they're popping up
faster than rabbits.

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:15.795
I think they want to eat me.

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:18.048
Evidence would suggest I'm tasty.

00:05:18.131 --> 00:05:19.674
Hiccy, a moment?

00:05:19.758 --> 00:05:22.594
Listen, I've been watching you walk.
[sighs]

00:05:22.677 --> 00:05:25.096
Lose the limp. No one's gonna marry that.

00:05:25.180 --> 00:05:26.348
I have a prosthetic leg.

00:05:26.431 --> 00:05:27.432
So have I.

00:05:27.515 --> 00:05:28.808
And I have a parasitic twin,

00:05:28.892 --> 00:05:31.061
but you don't see me
limping around about it.

00:05:31.394 --> 00:05:33.271
Come on. Chin up, Hiccy.

00:05:33.355 --> 00:05:34.439
Puff out that chest.

00:05:34.522 --> 00:05:36.649
Move that butt
to the left a little bit. [slaps]

00:05:36.733 --> 00:05:38.985
-[Hobgobblers snarling]
-[gasps]

00:05:39.819 --> 00:05:41.905
-[Cloudjumper roars]
-[crowd chattering]

00:05:44.949 --> 00:05:46.618
Mom, are you hurt?

00:05:46.701 --> 00:05:47.827
What happened out there?

00:05:47.911 --> 00:05:50.205
I don't know how,
but Grimmel is tracking us.

00:05:50.288 --> 00:05:53.708
Ahhh! This is all because
of the Hobgobblers.

00:05:53.875 --> 00:05:56.086
He has 100 ships, maybe more.

00:05:56.169 --> 00:05:58.838
With enough cages for all of our dragons.

00:05:59.005 --> 00:06:00.048
[exhales sharply]

00:06:00.632 --> 00:06:04.052
If Grimmel is leading them here,
we have to take him out of the mix.

00:06:04.469 --> 00:06:06.846
Uh, and how would we do that?

00:06:06.930 --> 00:06:08.807
By going there to capture him.

00:06:09.182 --> 00:06:10.433
Capture him?

00:06:11.351 --> 00:06:13.228
I'm with him! Who else?

00:06:14.979 --> 00:06:16.856
[humming a tune]

